{"id":570,"date":"2020-08-07T19:23:08","date_gmt":"2020-08-07T19:23:08","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shs.sherwood.k12.or.us\/?page_id=570"},"modified":"2026-01-16T13:06:53","modified_gmt":"2026-01-16T21:06:53","slug":"college-career-center","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/shs.sherwood.k12.or.us\/resources\/college-career-center\/","title":{"rendered":"College and Career Center"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-background\" style=\"color:#ffffff;background-color:#917f80;font-size:24px\"><strong>Our College and Career Center Team<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Liz Barrett<\/strong>: Career Center Director\/TOSA<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Contact the Career Center: shscareercenter@sherwood.k12.or.us<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-background\" style=\"color:#ffffff;background-color:#a3000b;font-size:22px\"><strong>Senior College Planning Night<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Couldn&#8217;t make it to <strong>Senior College Planning Night<\/strong>?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Click <a href=\"https:\/\/docs.google.com\/presentation\/d\/11_H2PIt78bBmSmi0kEJ9z7eMidCb0Jt8\/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=102932221520756926334&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true\">here<\/a> to see the presentation. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong><mark style=\"color:#130201\" class=\"has-inline-color\"><em>Check out the resources we shared<\/em>:<\/mark><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/docs.google.com\/presentation\/d\/11_H2PIt78bBmSmi0kEJ9z7eMidCb0Jt8\/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=102932221520756926334&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true\">Senior Resource Packet<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1w9jsgdBU7GfkquP46uc8YD1WaLrHQSo-\/view?usp=sharing\">Scholarship Brochure<\/a> <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>ECMC Opportunities Guide (Preparing for College Booklet): <a href=\"https:\/\/issuu.com\/ecmc_corpcomm\/docs\/2025-2026_national-opps-book_web?fr=xIAEoAT3_MzMz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English<\/a> | <a href=\"https:\/\/issuu.com\/ecmc_corpcomm\/docs\/2025-26-natl-opps-book-sp?fr=xIAEoAT3_MzMz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Spanish<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><em>The Opportunities Guide includes articles and worksheets aimed at guiding you through the college application and financial aid\/FAFSA process.<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>College Tips for Parents\/Legal Guardians (ECMC): <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ecmc.org\/media\/sx3pqglz\/college-planning-tips-for-parents.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English<\/a> | <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ecmc.org\/media\/dwtp2edc\/college-tips-for-parents-spanish.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Spanish<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>6 Ways to Pay for College: <a href=\"https:\/\/oregongoestocollege.org\/sites\/ogtc\/files\/resources\/6waystopay.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English<\/a> | <a href=\"https:\/\/oregongoestocollege.org\/sites\/ogtc\/files\/resources\/6waystopay-spanish.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Spanish<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/oregongoestocollege.org\/sites\/ogtc\/files\/resources\/checklist-adult.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">How to Help: College Checklist<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/docs.google.com\/document\/d\/1Tjr4HU7zVPgpe-T9czqPqUs9ACCEhOpVIUtV6Gn_cok\/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">College Application Planner<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Accessing College as a Student Living with a Disability (ECMC): <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ecmc.org\/media\/zpfbrur2\/accessing-college-as-a-student-with-disabilities.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">English<\/a> | <a href=\"https:\/\/www.ecmc.org\/media\/bb2njhju\/accessing-college-as-a-student-living-with-a-disability-spanish.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Spanish<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Housing Insecurity and College (