rm?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Sherwood High School Athletic Booster Club Scholarship Application<\/a>: <strong>Information for 2026 is pending<\/strong>. *<strong>LOCAL*<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/againstthegrainproductions.com\/our-causes\/scholarship\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Against the Grain Scholarships<\/a>: May 31st<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-background\" style=\"color:#ffffff;background-color:#a3000b;font-size:22px\"><strong>Military Visits<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Military Visits take place in the Commons during lunch. Click <a href=\"https:\/\/calendar.google.com\/calendar\/u\/0\/embed?src=c_bmmjre51stk9abphqjsriferi0@group.calendar.google.com&amp;ctz=America\/Los_Angeles\">here<\/a> to see upcoming visits. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-background\" style=\"color:#ffffff;background-color:#a3000b;font-size:22px\"><strong>Career Talks<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>Career Talks will start in January. <\/strong>Sign up for Flex in the Career Center to listen to guest speakers from a number of industries talk about their careers and how they got them.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">All visits will take place during Flex. Sign up for Flex with Ms. Barrett in order to attend.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Click <a href=\"https:\/\/calendar.google.com\/calendar\/embed?src=c_bmmjre51stk9abphqjsriferi0%40group.calendar.google.com&amp;ctz=America%2FLos_Angeles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here<\/a> to see full schedule of events on the Career Center Calendar.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-background\" style=\"color:#ffffff;background-color:#b2b7b9;font-size:24px\"><strong><em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline\">Upcoming Workshops<\/span>:<\/em> <\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>For the complete calendar of Career Center events, please click<a href=\"https:\/\/calendar.google.com\/calendar\/embed?src=c_bmmjre51stk9abphqjsriferi0%40group.calendar.google.com&amp;ctz=America%2FLos_Angeles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"> here<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><em>These Events have passed but have great information.  Here are the recordings:<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>FAFSA\/ORSAA Workshop<\/strong> &#8211; <a href=\"https:\/\/tinyurl.com\/53szwtnr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">(Recording)<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>FAFSA\/ORSAA Workshop<\/strong> <a href=\"https:\/\/tinyurl.com\/3vn6hvre\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">(Spanish-Recording)<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Job Corps Workshop <\/strong>(<a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=K6SZrSGRs2Q\">recording of event<\/a>)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-background\" style=\"background-color:#b2b7b9;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline\">Helpful Links &amp; Events:<\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-background has-medium-font-size\" style=\"background-color:#a10608;color:#ffffff\"><strong>Transcript Review:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1-xmPzlQGEzHqoaPz8Fdz9ZLmv60CSmpt\/view?usp=sharing\" data-type=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1-xmPzlQGEzHqoaPz8Fdz9ZLmv60CSmpt\/view?usp=sharing\">Transcript Review Video<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-background has-medium-font-size\" style=\"color:#ffffff;background-color:#a10608\"><strong><em>Financing College:<\/em><\/strong>  Federal and State Student Aid Websites Below<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/oregonstudentaid.gov\/fafsa-orsaa.aspx\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2020\/12\/iStock-1133551663.jpg\" alt=\"FAFSA logo\" class=\"wp-image-944\" width=\"428\" height=\"200\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><a href=\"https:\/\/oregonstudentaid.gov\/orsaa-filter.aspx\">Click Here to Access FAFSA or ORSAA Resources \/ Haga clic aqu\u00ed para los recursos de la FAFSA o ORSAA<\/a><\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/oregonstudentaid.gov\/oregon-promise.aspx\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2020\/12\/oregon-promise-w-or_0.png\" alt=\"Oregon Promise logo\" class=\"wp-image-961\" width=\"324\" height=\"254\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><a href=\"https:\/\/oregonstudentaid.gov\/oregon-promise.aspx\">Click Here to Access Info about the Oregon Promise Grant<\/a><\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/oregonstudentaid.gov\/scholarships\/osac-scholarship-application\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2025\/12\/OR-STUDENT-AID-2.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5057\" width=\"324\" height=\"166\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><a href=\"https:\/\/oregonstudentaid.gov\/scholarships\/osac-scholarship-application\/\">Click Here to Access Info about Oregon Student Aid (OSAC)<\/a><\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/user\/aspireoregon\/videos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/pbs.twimg.com\/profile_images\/1229825195470254080\/UE9bLQPO_400x400.jpg\" alt=\"Higher Education Coordinating Commission logo\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">The Office of Student Access and Completion (through Oregon Department of Education) has many helpful videos on their YouTube channel about FAFSA, OSAC Scholarships, Oregon Promise, and more.<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-background has-medium-font-size\" style=\"color:#ffffff;background-color:#a30003\"><strong><em>College Application Tools:<\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.schoolinks.com\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2025\/11\/SchooLinksog-1024x577.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5019\" width=\"238\" height=\"132\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.schoolinks.com\/\">Click here for SchooLinks Resources <\/a><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"http:\/\/oregongoestocollege.org\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2020\/12\/dVDZGgQ5_400x400.jpg\" alt=\"Oregon Goes to College logo\" class=\"wp-image-967\" width=\"238\" height=\"238\" srcset=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2020\/12\/dVDZGgQ5_400x400.jpg 400w, https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2020\/12\/dVDZGgQ5_400x400-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2020\/12\/dVDZGgQ5_400x400-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 238px) 100vw, 238px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><a href=\"http:\/\/oregongoestocollege.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Access Oregon Goes to College Resources<\/a><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-background has-medium-font-size\" style=\"color:#ffffff;background-color:#a30003\"><strong><em>Career Exploration Opportunities:<\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.pps.net\/futureyou2go\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2020\/12\/future_you_2_go_lrglogo.png\" alt=\"PPS Future You 2 Go logo\" class=\"wp-image-956\" width=\"290\" height=\"184\" srcset=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2020\/12\/future_you_2_go_lrglogo.png 322w, https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2020\/12\/future_you_2_go_lrglogo-300x190.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 290px) 100vw, 290px\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.pps.net\/futureyou2go\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Register for Future You 2 Go Career Events <\/a><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.officialasvab.com\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2025\/12\/ASVAB-1024x339.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5058\" width=\"611\" height=\"200\" \/><\/a><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.officialasvab.com\/\">Click Here to Learn More and Register for ASVAB testing with the Military <\/a><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-background has-medium-font-size\" style=\"color:#ffffff;background-color:#a30003\"><strong><em>Standardized Testing:<\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/collegereadiness.collegeboard.org\/sat\/register\/find-test-centers\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2020\/12\/SAT_1.jpg\" alt=\"SAT logo\" class=\"wp-image-950\" width=\"266\" height=\"266\" srcset=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2020\/12\/SAT_1.jpg 400w, https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2020\/12\/SAT_1-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2020\/12\/SAT_1-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 266px) 100vw, 266px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Click <a hre